@startuml accounts-preferences-sequence
!include ../../_style/sequence.iuml
title Accounts > Preferences — the sign-in reads the account, then a change goes up

actor Reader
participant "Component\n+ usePreference" as Component
participant "preferences.js\n+ localStorage" as Store
participant PreferencesApi as Api
participant "accountRouter\n+ authenticateToken, rateLimit" as Router
participant "accountService\n+ preferencesRules" as Service
participant userModel as UserModel
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Sign-in ==
Store -> Store : startPreferences(userId): the account of this browser?\n(another one: the defaults)
Component -> Store : kept() — the browser's value, at once
Store -> Api : get()
Api -> Router : GET /api/account/preferences
alt no valid session, or more than 60 reads in 10 minutes
    Router --> Api : 403 / 429
    Api --> Store : {error}: the browser's values stay
end
Router -> Service : preferences(req.user.id)
Service -> UserModel : preferences(userId)
UserModel -> DB : SELECT preferences FROM users
Service --> Api : 200 {preferences}
Api --> Store : {preferences}
loop each preference
    alt changed here and never sent
        Store -> Store : the browser's value goes up
    else the account has a value the page offers
        Store -> Store : it wins, kept in localStorage
    else the account has none
        Store -> Store : what the browser kept goes up
    end
end
Store --> Component : told (useSyncExternalStore): drawn again

== A change ==
Reader -> Component : ticks a box, chooses a size
Component -> Store : keep(value)
Store -> Store : localStorage, name noted as not sent yet
Store --> Component : told at once
Store -> Store : wait 800 ms (another change starts it again)
Store -> Api : save({size: 30, format: 'digest'}): only what changed
Api -> Router : PUT /api/account/preferences
Router -> Service : savePreferences(req.user.id, body)
Service -> Service : checkedPreferences(body)
alt a key or a value the page does not have, empty, over 4096 bytes
    Service --> Api : 400 / 413, nothing saved
    Api --> Store : {error}: kept in the browser, silently
end
Service -> UserModel : mergePreferences(userId, changes)
UserModel -> DB : UPDATE users SET preferences = preferences || $1::jsonb
Service --> Api : 200 {preferences}
Api --> Store : sent: no longer noted
@enduml
